      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106363020,
      "text": "シアーバターノキ Vitellaria paradoxa はアカテツ科の1属1種の双子葉植物で、常緑の小高木。シアバターの原料となる。ナイジェリアの言語由来のエミエミ（emi-emi）という名称でも呼ばれる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Vitellaria」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitellaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1357736107,
      "text": "Vitellaria paradoxa, commonly known as shea tree, shi tree, or vitellaria, is a tree of the family Sapotaceae. It is the only species in the genus Vitellaria, and is indigenous to Africa."
    }
